{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118804","id":3561098547,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7UQg0z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118804","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118804.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118804.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118804","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118804/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118804/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118804/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/24e76381d193dcb90d19d309a4caaaa4963087da","number":118804,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix MSAA 3D internal buffer being recreated every frame","user":{"login":"WSQS","id":17792626,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzkyNjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17792626?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS","html_url":"https://github.com/WSQS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What this PR does\r\n\r\nInitializes `msaa3d.color` in the internal buffer path when setting up 3D MSAA.\r\n\r\nWithout this, the setup check will treat the MSAA buffer as uninitialized and recreate it every frame. This causes unnecessary resource recreation and lead to leaks on android platform.\r\n\r\n## Why\r\n\r\nIn the `use_internal_buffer` path, `msaa3d.fbo` is created, but `msaa3d.color` was not initialized before the setup state was checked again later.\r\n\r\nGenerating the renderbuffer here makes the MSAA state consistent with the rest of the setup flow and prevents repeated recreation.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n- Built and ran the affected renderer path\r\n- Verified the framebuffer setup still completes successfully\r\n- Verified the MSAA 3D internal buffer is no longer recreated every frame\r\n\r\n## Acknowledgments\r\n\r\nThanks to [陈晨阳](https://github.com/Chency1126) and [李宇飞](https://github.com/Liyufei1).\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/fol